<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- ==========================================================================
     beans.xml — the marker file that says "CDI, look in this archive".

     Nothing in Practical 1 strictly needs it: our beans are enterprise beans,
     and those are discovered with or without this file. It is here because
     Practicals 2 and 3 are built on CDI, and because an empty beans.xml is the
     most common file in every Jakarta EE project. No harm, no cost.

     ========================================================================
     PRACTICAL 3: note what is NOT in this file.

     The application has an interceptor (BankAuditInterceptor), and the version
     of CDI most tutorials were written against required it to be listed here:

         <interceptors>
             <class>com.globalbank.interceptors.BankAuditInterceptor</class>
         </interceptors>

     It is not listed, because it does not need to be. Since CDI 1.1 an
     interceptor annotated @Priority is enabled for the whole application with no
     XML at all, and that is the route this project takes — there is no file to
     forget to update, and no way for the annotation and the XML to disagree.

     The XML form is still worth recognising when you meet it in somebody else's
     project, and worth using when you want to switch an interceptor on and off
     per deployment without recompiling. The rule of thumb:

         listed here  -> someone can turn it off by editing this file
         @Priority    -> it is simply on

     ========================================================================

     bean-discovery-mode="all" means "treat every class as a candidate bean".
     A one-line file is perfectly valid — the version and schema attributes are
     the only required content.
     ========================================================================== -->
<beans xmlns="https://jakarta.ee/xml/ns/jakartaee"
       xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
       xsi:schemaLocation="https://jakarta.ee/xml/ns/jakartaee
                           https://jakarta.ee/xml/ns/jakartaee/beans_4_0.xsd"
       version="4.0"
       bean-discovery-mode="all">
</beans>
